  "Total 60 as published. Starting (8): the Objective (posted 'COTVG'), Tatooine: Great Pit Of Carkoon, Jabba's Palace: Audience Chamber, Jabba's Palace: Dungeon, Prepared Defenses, Oppressive Enforcement, Mobilization Points and No Escape. Several Effects start, so no single starting Effect is set. The repeated title line above the list is not a card.",
  "The author posted a revised list the next day as 'Take 2' (post 11821, Jabba & Court Goes 2 Space Take 2).",
  "Posted 'COTVG' dested Court Of The Vile Gangster / I Shall Enjoy Watching You Die; 'DVDLOTS' Darth Vader, Dark Lord Of The Sith; 'Darth with Stick' Darth Vader With Lightsaber; 'Mara Jade' Mara Jade, The Emperor's Hand; 'Dr. E' Dr. Evazan; 'Chimera' Chimaera; 'Dreadnaught' Dreadnaught-Class Heavy Cruiser; 'IG in IG-2000' IG-88 In IG-2000; 'ZIMH' Zuckuss In Mist Hunter; 'Twi'lek' Twi'lek Advisor; 'Vader's Stick' Vader's Lightsaber; 'Mara's Stick' Mara Jade's Lightsaber.",
  "Sniper is the A New Hope Interrupt and Monnok the Jabba's Palace Interrupt (the Reflections II combos came out later); Oppressive Enforcement is the Special Edition Effect. Sullust, Kiffex, Kashyyyk, Endor and Tatooine: Cantina as posted (Dark versions)."
